  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Strengthening Regional Responses to Reduce the Impact of HIV/AIDS on Older People programme enables the HelpAge Africa Regional Development Centre (ARDC) and its partners to strengthen, expand and scale-up their interventions to alleviate the impact of HIV/AIDS on older people. Very crucially, the programme also enables ARDC to advocate for inclusion of older people</narrative>
